@startuml
title Customer Login
autonumber
skinparam Style strictuml
skinparam SequenceMessageAlignment center
skinparam boxPadding 10

box "User" #E6F0FA
actor "Customer" as Customer
end box

box "Client" #E6F9E6
participant "DisputeX Web App" as Frontend
end box

box "DisputeX Backend" #FFF9E6
participant "DisputeX API" as Api
participant "Authentication Service" as Auth
participant "Token Service" as Token
end box

box "Data" #F2E6FF
database "Customer Store" as DB
end box

note over Api: Public endpoint - no token required

Customer -> Frontend: Enter email and password
Frontend -> Api: Submit login request

Api -> Auth: Authenticate credentials
Auth -> DB: Look up customer by email
DB --> Auth: Customer record (with stored password)
Auth -> Auth: Verify password

alt #LightPink Invalid credentials
    Auth --> Api: Authentication failed
    Api --> Frontend: Login rejected (invalid email or password)
    Frontend --> Customer: Show login error
else #LightGreen Credentials valid
    Auth -> Token: Issue access token for customer
    Token --> Auth: Access token
    Auth --> Api: Authenticated (token + customer summary)
    Api --> Frontend: Login successful (token returned)
    Frontend --> Customer: Redirect to dashboard
end
@enduml